          },
          "docs": "CreateGenerativeExchangeSSE Service:\nThis service sends GenerativeExchangeSSEData messages with DELTA state as \"Data-Only\" Server-Sent Events (SSE) when available. The stream terminates with a GenerativeExchangeSSEData message containing the COMPLETE state.\nEach message is sent approximately within a second or less of each other. If clients do not receive a message within their specified timeout, they should assume the connection is lost and attempt to reconnect.\nReference:\nhttps://html.spec.wha"
        },
